{
 "id": "280-39",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "It's an essential skill to have, especially in a distributed work environment like ours.",
  "Now, the first step is always to identify the scope of the problem.",
  "It's also a good idea to have backup internet connections in place, especially for critical locations.",
  "That way, if there's an issue with the primary connection, we can fail over to the backup and minimize downtime.",
  "If an error occurs within the try block, we can catch it and provide appropriate feedback or take alternative actions.",
  "Exactly.",
  "So, going forward, I want you to make sure that you always include try statements in your functions.",
  "And if you have any questions or need any further clarification on this, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "Keep up the good work, and don't be afraid to experiment and learn from your mistakes.",
  "Visual aids and demonstrations are always impactful.",
  "As you know, no technology is without its limitations.",
  "Open communication and feedback are key pillars of a healthy work environment.",
  "Creating a culture of feedback is essential.",
  "It's important that we not only give feedback but also receive it gracefully and use it as a tool for self-improvement.",
  "It's also important to provide context and explain the rationale behind our suggestions.",
  "Absolutely.",
  "Building a culture of trust and transparency takes time and consistent effort.",
  "But with the right strategies and a shared commitment, I'm confident we can create a highly collaborative and supportive team environment."
 ],
