   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 11,
   "span_start": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "14:12",
   "text": "It's also a good idea to have backup internet connections in place, especially for critical locations.",
   "key": "new:14:12",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 14,
   "span_start": 12
  },
  {
   "id": "14:115",
   "text": "That way, if there's an issue with the primary connection, we can fail over to the backup and minimize downtime.",
   "key": "new:14:115",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 14,
   "span_start": 115
  },
  {
   "id": "16:173",
   "text": "If an error occurs within the try block, we can catch it and provide appropriate feedback or take alternative actions.",
   "key": "new:16:173",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 16,
   "span_start": 173
  },
  {
   "id": "17:0",
   "text": "Exactly.",
   "key": "new:17:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 17,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "17:85",
   "text": "So, going forward, I want you to make sure that you always include try statements in your functions.",
   "key": "new:17:85",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 17,
   "span_start": 85
  },
  {
   "id": "18:7",
